          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Traversal and scoring time.\n\nPercentiles: n% of events were at or under this value.\np50 - the median. Half were faster; this is the typical experience.\np95 - 1 in 20 were slower. Objectives are written against this because it catches a bad tail that an average hides.\np99 - 1 in 100 were slower. The worst realistic case. A p99 far above p95 means a small group of events behaves very differently.\nNo average is shown on purpose: one 10-second outlier and a thousand fast events average to a number nobody experienced.\n\nDashed line is the ~40ms graph latency objective."
    },
